{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "id": "loop-branch-exit-example",
  "name": "循环综合测试：分支与退出",
  "description": "默认 pass3，第三轮退出。mode 可选 immediate、pass3、stop2、normal2、never。导入后为四个 Agent 选择本机可用的执行器、模型和角色。无 Skill/MCP 依赖。",
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-24T17:06:45.199046+08:00",
  "viewport": {
    "x": 30,
    "y": 70,
    "zoom": 0.45
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "workflow",
      "position": {
        "x": 50,
        "y": 310
      },
      "data": {
        "kind": "start",
        "title": "开始：选择测试模式",
        "description": "",
        "inputVariables": [
          {
            "name": "mode",
            "displayName": "测试模式",
            "fieldType": "select",
            "valueType": "string",
            "required": true,
            "options": ["immediate", "pass3", "stop2", "normal2", "never"],
            "value": "pass3"
          }
        ]
      },
      "deletable": false
    },
    {
      "id": "review-loop",
      "type": "workflow",
      "position": {
        "x": 450,
        "y": 100
      },
      "data": {
        "kind": "loop",
        "title": "评审循环",
        "description": "",
        "loopConfig": {
          "maxIterations": 4,
          "variables": [
            {
              "name": "round",
              "valueType": "string",
              "initial": {
                "kind": "constant",
                "value": "1"
              },
              "feedback": ["next-round", "output"]
            },
            {
              "name": "previousDraft",
              "valueType": "string",
              "initial": {
                "kind": "constant",
                "value": "EMPTY"
              },
              "feedback": ["writer", "output"]
            }
          ],
          "until": {
            "logic": "and",
            "conditions": [
              {
                "variableSelector": ["reviewer", "output"],
                "operator": "equals",
                "value": "DONE"
              }
            ]
          },
          "outputs": [
            {
              "name": "finalDraft",
              "variableSelector": ["writer", "output"]
            },
            {
              "name": "decision",
              "variableSelector": ["reviewer", "output"]
            },
            {
              "name": "finishedRound",
              "variableSelector": ["review-loop", "round"]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "initialWidth": 1660,
      "initialHeight": 750
    },
    {
      "id": "round-start",
      "type": "workflow",
      "position": {
        "x": 40,
        "y": 210
      },
      "data": {
        "kind": "start",
        "title": "轮次开始",
        "description": "",
        "containerId": "review-loop"
      },
      "deletable": false,
      "parentId": "review-loop"
    },
    {
      "id": "writer",
      "type": "workflow",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 210
      },
      "data": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "title": "Agent A：生成内容",
        "description": "",
        "containerId": "review-loop",
        "agentConfig": {
          "schemaVersion": 3,
          "executor": {
            "agentCli": "official/ora-space.codeagentcli",
            "modelId": "gpt-5"
          },
          "roleId": "Implementer",
          "skills": [],
          "mcps": [],
          "prompt": "你是工作流测试中的内容生成器。\n当前轮次：{{#review-loop.round#}}\n上一轮内容：{{#review-loop.previousDraft#}}\n只输出一行：DRAFT_<当前轮次>|previous=<上一轮内容>\n将尖括号及其中说明替换为实际输入值。不要解释，不要使用 Markdown，不要调用工具。",
          "interactive": false
        }
      },
      "parentId": "review-loop"
    },
    {
      "id": "reviewer",
      "type": "workflow",
      "position": {
        "x": 680,
        "y": 210
      },
      "data": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "title": "Agent B：评审",
        "description": "",
        "containerId": "review-loop",
        "agentConfig": {
          "schemaVersion": 3,
          "executor": {
            "agentCli": "official/ora-space.codeagentcli",
            "modelId": "gpt-5"
          },
          "roleId": "Implementer",
          "skills": [],
          "mcps": [],
          "prompt": "你是工作流测试中的确定性评审器。\n测试模式：{{#start.mode#}}\n当前轮次：{{#review-loop.round#}}\n本轮内容：{{#writer.output#}}\n严格按规则输出：\n1. mode 为 immediate：输出 PASS。\n2. mode 为 pass3：当前轮次为 3 时输出 PASS，否则输出 CONTINUE。\n3. mode 为 stop2：当前轮次为 2 时输出 STOP，否则输出 CONTINUE。\n4. mode 为 normal2：当前轮次为 2 时输出 DONE，否则输出 CONTINUE。\n5. 其他 mode：输出 CONTINUE。\n只输出一个大写单词，不要解释、引号、标点或 Markdown，不要调用工具。",
          "interactive": false
        }
      },
      "parentId": "review-loop"
    },
    {
      "id": "decision",
      "type": "workflow",
      "position": {
        "x": 1000,
        "y": 210
      },
      "data": {
        "kind": "condition",
        "title": "条件分支：评审结果",
        "description": "",
        "containerId": "review-loop",
        "cases": [
          {
            "id": "pass",
            "logic": "and",
            "conditions": [
              {
                "variableSelector": ["reviewer", "output"],
                "operator": "equals",
                "value": "PASS"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "stop",
            "logic": "and",
            "conditions": [
              {
                "variableSelector": ["reviewer", "output"],
                "operator": "equals",
                "value": "STOP"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "parentId": "review-loop"
    },
